{
  "longTitle": "To make provision about slavery, servitude and forced or compulsory labour; to make provision about human trafficking; to make provision for an Anti-slavery Commissioner; and for connected purposes.",
  "summary": "<p>The Bill consolidates the current offences relating to trafficking and slavery. </p><p><strong>Key areas</strong></p><ul><li>creates two new civil orders to prevent modern slavery </li><li>establishes an Anti-Slavery Commissioner</li><li>makes provision for the protection of modern slavery victims.<br></li></ul>",
